<title>RUSSIA: Russia wants De Beers gem deal - finance minister.</title>
<headline>Russia wants De Beers gem deal - finance minister.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian Finance Minister Alexander Livshits said on Tuesday that Russia still wanted a gem export deal with De Beers and that Moscow could have comments on the status of the long-delayed deal later this week.</p>
<p>&quot;The final task is clear; it was formulated earlier. We want to continue mutually advantageous work with De Beers and to go to the stage where we can sign an agreement,&quot; Livshits told a news conference.</p>
</text>
